From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Telesphoreo <me@telesphoreo.me>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:59:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Reject oversized entity selectors

Reject command selector distance and volume bounds beyond 1024 blocks, along with non-finite x, y, and z coordinates, before they can trigger invalid or enormous queries. Apply the same checks to programmatically constructed selectors and rate-limit rejection logging.

